  assertions, plus 86 baseline static case registrations and 86 native static
  registrations. The generated presenter cases expand the batch to 89 runtime
  cases and remain separately named and filterable.
- A normalized file-by-file comparison reconstructed each spec from its
  baseline file using only the declared suite, registration, and assertion
  substitutions. All 18 matched exactly, proving harness construction,
  snapshots, CP437 bytes, geometry, pointer zones, tooltip text, and sort data
  did not drift during conversion.
