## Completion criteria

- All 57 baseline suites have exactly one native `*_spec.lua` successor; 56
  retain their baseline stem and `luaunit_setup_test.lua` becomes
  `busted_setup_spec.lua`.
- Busted discovers and executes all 332 tests.
- The complete result is 328 passing tests and only the four named existing
  search-ranking failures.
- No LuaUnit dependency, import, assertion, runner, suite table, discovery
  variable, or active setup documentation remains.
- Fresh and warm dependency runs, targeted execution, forced failure, syntax
  validation, and package exclusion are proven with recorded evidence.
- Production source and installed-mod behavior are unchanged.
